      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 · GET FUNDING ROUNDS (tech.eu)\nAsks tech.eu for German funding rounds.\n\n**Change in the URL of `GetStartups`:**\n- `days: 90` → how far back to look\n- `country=Germany` → which country\n- `limit=100` → rounds per request (100 is the max)\n\nNeed more than 100 rounds? Turn on **Pagination** (GetStartups → Options → Pagination).\n\n**Keep ON:** Settings → Execute Once",
