    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · SKIP KNOWN + KEEP EARLY STAGE\n- `Compare Datasets` → drops companies already in Notion\n- `CleanFields` → simple fields\n- `Filter` → early-stage rounds only\n\n**Change in `Filter`:**\n- `['Pre-Seed','Seed','Series A']` → stages to keep\n- `15000000` → max amount (€) for \"Other\" rounds",
        "height": 260,
