      "name": "Note 2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 · HOW MANY COMPANIES\n`Limit` → Max Items\n- 3 = quick test\n- 20 = normal daily run\n- 100 = everything that passed the filter\n\n≈ 3–5 Tavily searches per company.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 380
