      "name": "Note 3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 · FIND THE REAL WEBSITE\n- `FindWebsite` → searches for the official site\n- `PickWebsite` → accepts only a domain that contains the company name\n- `HasWebsite` → no website? → saved as \"research by hand\"\n\n**Change:** early-stage founding year → `PickWebsite` → `>= 2021`",
        "height": 240,
