      "name": "Note 4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 · FIND FOUNDER NAMES\n- `SearchImpressum` → the company's legal page (German law: must name the managing directors)\n- `SearchNews` → funding articles\n- `ExtractFounder` → AI pulls names ONLY from that text\n\n**Change:** articles read → `SearchNews` → Max Results · rules → `ExtractFounder` → System Message",
        "height": 260,
